{"id":"belleza","lemma":"belleza","pos":"noun","rank":1095,"glosses":["beauty (the quality of being beautiful)","beauty (beautiful person or object)"],"ipa":"/beˈʝeθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bellezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-belleza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella es una belleza.","en":"She's a beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442006","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La belleza no es importante.","en":"Beauty isn't important.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460880","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"important"}]},{"text":"Su hermana es una auténtica belleza.","en":"His sister is a real beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639946","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"sister"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"authentic, real, true","l":"auténtico"},null]},{"text":"Estaba fascinado por su belleza.","en":"I was fascinated by her beauty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926296","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to fascinate","l":"fascinar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Envidio tu belleza.","en":"I envy you your beauty.","words":[{"g":"to envy","l":"envidiar"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}